{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40728","headline":"赠长安毕郎中 · 李洞","name":"赠长安毕郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高门寒沼水连云，鹭识朱衣傍主人。\n地肺半边晴带雪，天街一面静无尘。\n朝回座客酬琴价，衙退留僧写鹤真。\n从此几迁爲计相，蓬莱三刻奏东巡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}